  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 6 Question 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Why is God worthy of our trust?
  answers:
  - Your parents said so
  - Because God is perfect
  - Because God makes mistakes
  - Your pastor said so
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: God is the perfect and unchangeable King.  We can trust Him because
    He is in control of everything, and He always fulfills what He's promised. He
    says that all who repent and come to Him, He will cleanse and accept.
